     3	- The legacy system at `~/Projects/nedlern` is read-only reference: read anything there freely; NOT: modify anything there or execute its code.
     4	- Use standard SDLC terms.
     5	- Write durable artifacts — committed files, issue bodies, commit messages — for a reader with zero context: the subject identifiable, the why stated, usable without the conversation that produced it.
